            {
              "file": "MARLIN_IMPLEMENTATION_SUMMARY.md",
              "patch": "Index: MARLIN_IMPLEMENTATION_SUMMARY.md\n===================================================================\n--- MARLIN_IMPLEMENTATION_SUMMARY.md\t\n+++ MARLIN_IMPLEMENTATION_SUMMARY.md\t\n@@ -0,0 +1,69 @@\n+# Marlin Format Support Implementation Summary\n+\n+## Changes Made\n+\n+### 1. Created `auto_gptq/utils/marlin_utils.py`\n+- Added `_get_cached_marlin_save_name(model_name_or_path)` function\n+- Returns path containing \"assets\" substring for both local and remote models\n+- Local: `{model_path}/assets/marlin_model.safetensors`\n+- Remote: HuggingFace cache assets path\n+\n+### 2. Updated `auto_gptq/utils/__init__.py`\n+- Exported `_get_cached_marlin_save_name` function\n+\n+### 3. Updated `auto_gptq/modeling/_base.py`\n+\n+#### BaseQuantizeConfig class:\n+- Added `is_marlin_format: bool = field(default=False)` field\n+- Updated `to_dict()` to include `is_marlin_format`\n+\n+#### save_quantized method:\n+- When `is_marlin_format=True`, saves to `model.safetensors` instead of `{basename}.safetensors`\n+- Does not create `autogptq_model.safetensors` for Marlin format models\n+- Updates `model_file_base_name` to match the saved filename\n+\n+#### from_quantized method:\n+- **File Detection**: Checks for `model.safetensors` when `use_marlin=True` or `is_marlin_format=True`\n+- **Model Creation**: Creates MarlinQuantLinear modules directly when loading pre-converted Marlin models\n+- **Marlin Loading Path**:\n+  - Checks for cached Marlin model using `_get_cached_marlin_save_name`\n+  - **Cache Hit**: Loads from cache directly (fast path)\n+  - **Pre-converted Model**: Loads `model.safetensors`, creates MarlinQuantLinear modules, loads checkpoint, caches for future\n+  - **GPTQ Model**: Loads GPTQ checkpoint, converts to Marlin with repacking, caches for future\n+- **Fast Load**: Subsequent loads use cached Marlin model (< 20% of initial load time)\n+\n+## Behavior\n+\n+### First Load (GPTQ model with use_marlin=True):\n+1. Load GPTQ model with standard QuantLinear modules\n+2. Load GPTQ checkpoint\n+3. Convert to Marlin format (repack weights)\n+4. Save to cache at `{assets_path}/marlin_model.safetensors`\n+5. Result: Model with MarlinQuantLinear modules\n+\n+### Second Load (same model with use_marlin=True):\n+1. Detect cached Marlin model exists\n+2. Create empty MarlinQuantLinear modules\n+3. Load cached Marlin checkpoint directly\n+4. Result: Model with MarlinQuantLinear modules (fast load)\n+\n+### Save Pretrained (Marlin model):\n+1. Save to `model.safetensors`\n+2. Save `quantize_config.json` with `is_marlin_format: true`\n+3. Does NOT create `autogptq_model.safetensors`\n+\n+### Load Saved Marlin Model:\n+1. Detect `is_marlin_format: true` in config\n+2. Find `model.safetensors` file\n+3. Create MarlinQuantLinear modules\n+4. Load Marlin checkpoint\n+5. Cache for future fast loading\n+6. Result: Model with MarlinQuantLinear modules (fast load)\n+\n+## Key Features\n+- ✅ Models loaded with `use_marlin=True` have MarlinQuantLinear modules\n+- ✅ Cached Marlin files use path from `_get_cached_marlin_save_name` (contains \"assets\")\n+- ✅ Subsequent loads are fast (< 20% of initial load time)\n+- ✅ `save_pretrained` writes `model.safetensors` and `quantize_config.json` with `is_marlin_format: true`\n+- ✅ No `autogptq_model.safetensors` created for Marlin format\n+- ✅ Reloading saved Marlin models yields MarlinQuantLinear modules with fast load\n",
